# This context is ros/. Do not send a host's local build state or
# recorded sensor data into any of the canonical source image builds.
.git/
.gitignore
build/
install/
log/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.venv/
**/.ros/
**/build/
**/install/
**/log/
**/*.db3
**/*.mcap
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-shm
**/*.sqlite3-wal
**/*.core
**/core.*
**/*.log
**/*.bag
**/*.bag.active
**/rosbags/
**/bags/
**/captures/
**/tmp/
**/run/
**/*~
# Intentionally keep src/, config/, launch, Dockerfile.* and tests.
# They are copied by the active multi-stage image recipes.
